    {
        "id": 2252212,
        "position": 1,
        "description": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_134300000000000001/attachments/27286931/dp_app.css\"><p><a class=\"instructure_file_link instructure_scribd_file inline_disabled\" title=\"Spring 2026_CSE 3314_Assignment_1-1.pdf\" href=\"https://uta.instructure.com/courses/265649/files/41339594?verifier=RXjEF5EECK1HEBsQzC2VGlP3cKqKGTqMh1UUcRuL&amp;wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-canvas-previewable=\"false\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://uta.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/265649/files/41339594\" data-api-returntype=\"File\">Spring 2026_CSE 3314_Assignment_1-1.pdf</a></p>\n<p><strong>NOTE:&nbsp; you do not need to attach an academic integrity form</strong></p>\n<p>Student Ethics Scenario Assigned</p>\n<p>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with A or B do Ethics scenario 9.3.2 \u2013 Protecting Personal Data, Pg 475<br>Last Name (Family Name Starts with C or D do ethics scenario 9.3.3 \u2013 Designing an Application with Targeted Ads, Pg 477<br>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with E or F do ethics scenario 9.3.4 \u2013 Webcams in School Laptops, Pg 479<br>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with G or H do ethics scenario 9.3.5 \u2013 Publishing Securities Vulnerabilities, Pg 480<br>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with I or J do ethics scenario 9.3.6 Specifications, Pg 481<br>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with K or L do ethics scenario 9.3.7 \u2013 Schedule Pressures: A safety-critical Application, Pg 482<br>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with M or N do ethics scenario 9.3.7 \u2013 Getting a Product to Market, Pg 484<br>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with O or P do ethics scenario 9.3.8 \u2013 Software License Violation, Pg 486<br>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with Q or R do ethics scenario 9.3.9 \u2013 Going Public with Safety Concerns, Pg 486<br>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with S or T do ethics scenario 9.3.10 \u2013 Release of Personal Information, Pg 488<br>Las Name (Family Name) Starts with U or V do ethics scenario 9.3.11 \u2013 Conflict of Interest, Pg 490<br>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with W or X do ethics scenario 9.3.12 \u2013 Kickbacks &amp; Disclosure, Pg 491<br>Last Name (Family Name) Starts with Y or Z do ethics scenario 9.3.13 \u2013 A Test Plan, Pg 492</p><script src=\"https://instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_134300000000000001/attachments/27286930/dp_app.js\"></script>",
